"Replace the unsafe first-claim admin model (admin.rs register_admin, which lets whoever calls first become admin) with a secret-token model: inject a secret token into the module's published data at publish time, and have the SpacetimeDB module verify that token on every privileged/admin action (push_assets and all GM reducers). Do not ship a first-claim bootstrap. Prior art to mine: server/src/admin.rs (orphaned) had require_admin/is_admin/register_admin and AdminIdentity."